# play system-details/alpine323 --------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the System Details screen proposed for slice$
# 1, inferred from origin/main (unreleased), read from a$
# simulated host, by real code where there is some (detect, the$
# header probe, accounts) and by the gallery's stand-ins$
# elsewhere, unit (b)'s to build. It only reads: no plan, no$
# y/N, no journal. Nothing on this machine changes: every$
# command and file is the fake's.$
$
# Info: system-details/alpine323$
# web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23.6, as the 2026-10-21 VM$
# (vmtest.md §8.6): kernel 6.18.53-0-virt, doas. BusyBox's ip$
# and df forms are [unverified]. alice ran doas hardn. Alpine$
# builds BusyBox's last without FEATURE_LAST_FANCY (aports 3.23-$
# stable busyboxconfig), which takes no argument at all: last -n$
# 1 alice prints its usage and fails (util-linux/last.c), so the$
# section can't be read this way. Whether /var/log/wtmp exists$
# on Alpine 3.23 is [unverified].$
$
